        "acip": "YANG RAB 'BYOR, CHOS DE NI, MNYAM PA STE, DE LA MI MNYAM PA GANG YANG MED PAS DES NA, BLA NA MED PA YANG DAG PAR RDZOGS PA'I BYANG CHUB CES BYA'O, ,BLA NA MED PA YANG DAG PAR RDZOGS PA'I BYANG CHUB DE NI, BDAG MED PA DANG, SEMS CAN MED PA DANG, SROG MED PA DANG, GANG ZAG MED PAR MNYAM PA STE, DGE BA'I CHOS THAMS CAD KYIS MNGON PAR RDZOGS PAR 'TSANG RGYA'O,,",
        "wylie": "yang rab 'byor, chos de ni, mnyam pa ste, de la mi mnyam pa gang yang med pas des na, bla na med pa yang dag par rdzogs pa'i byang chub ces bya'o, ,bla na med pa yang dag par rdzogs pa'i byang chub de ni, bdag med pa dang, sems can med pa dang, srog med pa dang, gang zag med par mnyam pa ste, dge ba'i chos thams cad kyis mngon par rdzogs par 'tshang rgya'o",
        "english": "I say to you further, o Subhuti, that this thing is completely equal; there is nothing at all about it which is not equal. This too is precisely why we can call it the \"unsurpassed, perfect, and total state of a Buddha.\" This unsurpassed, perfect, and total state of a Buddha is \"completely equal\" in being something without a self, and without a living being, and without something that lives, and without any person. Every single thing which is virtue leads to this total enlightenment.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"Sunlight\", \"acip\": \"YANG RAB 'BYOR, CHOS DE NI, MNYAM PA STE, DE LA MI MNYAM PA GANG YANG MED PAS DES NA, BLA NA MED PA YANG DAG PAR RDZOGS PA'I BYANG CHUB CES BYA'O, ,BLA NA MED PA YANG DAG PAR RDZOGS PA'I BYANG CHUB DE NI, BDAG MED PA DANG, SEMS CAN MED PA DANG, SROG MED PA DANG, GANG ZAG MED PAR MNYAM PA STE, DGE BA'I CHOS THAMS CAD KYIS MNGON PAR RDZOGS PAR 'TSANG RGYA'O,,\", \"wylie\": \"yang rab 'byor, chos de ni, mnyam pa ste, de la mi mnyam pa gang yang med pas des na, bla na med pa yang dag par rdzogs pa'i byang chub ces bya'o, ,bla na med pa yang dag par rdzogs pa'i byang chub de ni, bdag med pa dang, sems can med pa dang, srog med pa dang, gang zag med par mnyam pa ste, dge ba'i chos thams cad kyis mngon par rdzogs par 'tshang rgya'o\", \"english\": \"I say to you further, o Subhuti, that this thing is completely equal; there is nothing at all about it which is not equal. This too is precisely why we can call it the \\\"unsurpassed, perfect, and total state of a Buddha.\\\" This unsurpassed, perfect, and total state of a Buddha is \\\"completely equal\\\" in being something without a self, and without a living being, and without something that lives, and without any person. Every single thing which is virtue leads to this total enlightenment.\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 9467,
        "course": "TCS02",
        "seq": 193,
        "acip": ",SLAR NAM MKHA'I LAM LAS 'JA' TSON 'KHRUNGS, ,'JA' DE NYID MTSAN DPE'I 'OD DU 'BAR, ,THANGS DBANG PO'I GZHU YI NA CHUNG DANG , ,YUL 'OD GSAL CHANG GIS RTAG MYOS PA'I, ,DBYINGS LHAN SKYES GZHON NU MIG YANGS PO, ,DUS 'DU 'BRAL MED PA'I GROGS POR SONG , ,GROGS MDZA' BAS DNGOS PO GCIG TU 'DRES, ,DPAL ZAG MED NOR DANG LONGS SPYOD TSOGS, ,KHONG GZHAN LAS PHROGS TE BDAG GIR BZUNG , ,'DI BSAMS SHING RJE BTZUN BLA MA'I DRIN, ,DRIN CHE BAR NGOS SO BLA MA RJE,",
        "wylie": "slar nam mkha'i lam las 'ja' tshon 'khrungs, ,'ja' de nyid mtshan dpe'i 'od du 'bar, ,thangs dbang po'i gzhu yi na chung dang , ,yul 'od gsal chang gis rtag myos pa'i, ,dbyings lhan skyes gzhon nu mig yangs po, ,dus 'du 'bral med pa'i grogs por song , ,grogs mdza' bas dngos po gcig tu 'dres, ,dpal zag med nor dang longs spyod tshogs, ,khong gzhan las phrogs te bdag gir bzung , ,'di bsams shing rje btsun bla ma'i drin, ,drin che bar ngos so bla ma rje",
        "english": "And then from nowhere Came again a rainbow across the sky; The rainbow blazed In the marks and signs of an enlightened being-- There was a virgin, The cleft of method, the one of power, And then came a boy, Born of himself from the empty realm, Drunk from the wine Of the clear light of his home. They united, Never again to be apart: Friends and companions, Combined into a single thing. They tore from the others The immaculate, shining jewels And a mass of objects of enjoyment Claiming them then As their very own. When I think of this, I think of my Lama's kindness-- And oh how kind you have been to me, My Lama and my Lord.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS02\", \"acip\": \",SLAR NAM MKHA'I LAM LAS 'JA' TSON 'KHRUNGS, ,'JA' DE NYID MTSAN DPE'I 'OD DU 'BAR, ,THANGS DBANG PO'I GZHU YI NA CHUNG DANG , ,YUL 'OD GSAL CHANG GIS RTAG MYOS PA'I, ,DBYINGS LHAN SKYES GZHON NU MIG YANGS PO, ,DUS 'DU 'BRAL MED PA'I GROGS POR SONG , ,GROGS MDZA' BAS DNGOS PO GCIG TU 'DRES, ,DPAL ZAG MED NOR DANG LONGS SPYOD TSOGS, ,KHONG GZHAN LAS PHROGS TE BDAG GIR BZUNG , ,'DI BSAMS SHING RJE BTZUN BLA MA'I DRIN, ,DRIN CHE BAR NGOS SO BLA MA RJE,\", \"wylie\": \"slar nam mkha'i lam las 'ja' tshon 'khrungs, ,'ja' de nyid mtshan dpe'i 'od du 'bar, ,thangs dbang po'i gzhu yi na chung dang , ,yul 'od gsal chang gis rtag myos pa'i, ,dbyings lhan skyes gzhon nu mig yangs po, ,dus 'du 'bral med pa'i grogs por song , ,grogs mdza' bas dngos po gcig tu 'dres, ,dpal zag med nor dang longs spyod tshogs, ,khong gzhan las phrogs te bdag gir bzung , ,'di bsams shing rje btsun bla ma'i drin, ,drin che bar ngos so bla ma rje\", \"english\": \"And then from nowhere Came again a rainbow across the sky; The rainbow blazed In the marks and signs of an enlightened being-- There was a virgin, The cleft of method, the one of power, And then came a boy, Born of himself from the empty realm, Drunk from the wine Of the clear light of his home. They united, Never again to be apart: Friends and companions, Combined into a single thing. They tore from the others The immaculate, shining jewels And a mass of objects of enjoyment Claiming them then As their very own. When I think of this, I think of my Lama's kindness-- And oh how kind you have been to me, My Lama and my Lord.\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 9472,
        "course": "TCS02",
        "seq": 198,
        "acip": "DE NAS BYAMS PA SGOM TSUL NI, RANG GI MA LTA BU YID DU GANG GCAGS PA CIG LA DMIGS NAS, 'DI LA ZAG MED KYI BDE BA GA LA YOD, ZAG BCAS KYI BDE BA TZAM YANG MI 'DUG ,",
        "wylie": "de nas byams pa sgom tshul ni, rang gi ma lta bu yid du gang gcags pa cig la dmigs nas, 'di la zag med kyi bde ba ga la yod, zag bcas kyi bde ba tsam yang mi 'dug",
        "english": "Next comes the meditation on love, which you do as follows.  First visualize a person sitting in front of you who is as appealing to you as your very own mother.  Then take yourself through this train of thought: How could this person in front of me have any pure happiness at all?  They don't even have any happiness of the impure kind.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS02\", \"acip\": \"DE NAS BYAMS PA SGOM TSUL NI, RANG GI MA LTA BU YID DU GANG GCAGS PA CIG LA DMIGS NAS, 'DI LA ZAG MED KYI BDE BA GA LA YOD, ZAG BCAS KYI BDE BA TZAM YANG MI 'DUG ,\", \"wylie\": \"de nas byams pa sgom tshul ni, rang gi ma lta bu yid du gang gcags pa cig la dmigs nas, 'di la zag med kyi bde ba ga la yod, zag bcas kyi bde ba tsam yang mi 'dug\", \"english\": \"Next comes the meditation on love, which you do as follows.  First visualize a person sitting in front of you who is as appealing to you as your very own mother.  Then take yourself through this train of thought: How could this person in front of me have any pure happiness at all?  They don't even have any happiness of the impure kind.\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 11263,
        "course": "TCS04Mantras",
        "seq": 119,
        "acip": "MCHOD RDZAS SO SO'I RNAM PA CAN, BYED LAS MGRON RNAMS KYI MIG SOGS DBANG PO DRUG GI SPYOD YUL DU ZAG MED GYI BDE BAR KHYAD PAR CHAN BSKYED PA'I NUS PA DANG LDAN PAR BSAM,",
        "wylie": "mchod rdzas so so'i rnam pa can, byed las mgron rnams kyi mig sogs dbang po drug gi spyod yul du zag med gyi bde bar khyad par chan bskyed pa'i nus pa dang ldan par bsam",
        "english": "What these things look like is the various offerings.  What they have the power to do is to bring on an exceptional experience of pure bliss for the guests, by serving as the objects of their eyes and other senses. 14 Mantra for Inner Offering to the Slayer (Sadhana)",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS04Mantras\", \"acip\": \"MCHOD RDZAS SO SO'I RNAM PA CAN, BYED LAS MGRON RNAMS KYI MIG SOGS DBANG PO DRUG GI SPYOD YUL DU ZAG MED GYI BDE BAR KHYAD PAR CHAN BSKYED PA'I NUS PA DANG LDAN PAR BSAM,\", \"wylie\": \"mchod rdzas so so'i rnam pa can, byed las mgron rnams kyi mig sogs dbang po drug gi spyod yul du zag med gyi bde bar khyad par chan bskyed pa'i nus pa dang ldan par bsam\", \"english\": \"What these things look like is the various offerings.  What they have the power to do is to bring on an exceptional experience of pure bliss for the guests, by serving as the objects of their eyes and other senses. 14 Mantra for Inner Offering to the Slayer (Sadhana)\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 11589,
        "course": "TCS04PrayerBook",
        "seq": 250,
        "acip": ",H'Um ZAG MED YE SHES BDUD RTZIR BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,BDE BA CHEN PO'I TSOGS KYI MCHOD PA 'DI, ,RDO RJE 'CHANG DBANG BLO BZANG GRAGS PA DANG, ,DBYER MED RIGS KYI COD PAN DRIN CAN RJE, ,RTZA BA BRGYUD PA'I BLA MA RNAMS LA 'BUL, ,DGYES SHING BZHES NAS SGRUB MCHOG BDAG CAG LA, ,'PHRIN LAS RNAM BZHI GRUB PA CHEN PO BRGYAD, ,BLA MED MCHOG GI DNGOS GRUB STZAL DU GSOL,",
        "wylie": "hUM zag med ye shes bdud rtsir byin brlabs pa'i, ,bde ba chen po'i tshogs kyi mchod pa 'di, ,rdo rje 'chang dbang blo bzang grags pa dang, ,dbyer med rigs kyi cod pan drin can rje, ,rtsa ba brgyud pa'i bla ma rnams la 'bul, ,dgyes shing bzhes nas sgrub mchog bdag cag la, ,'phrin las rnam bzhi grub pa chen po brgyad, ,bla med mchog gi dngos grub stsal du gsol",
        "english": "Hung! Here is the Offering of the Gathering, Ecstasy itself, Blessed and become the nectar of deathlessness, Immaculate understanding. And we offer it to To our root and lineage Lamas: To You of greatest kindness, Crowning jewels of Enlightened Kind, Completely indivisible From the Keeper of the Diamond-- Lobsang Drakpa himself. Be pleased, we beg You, With our gift, and accept it from us. For we are high practitioners, And we ask that You grant us The power of the four mighty deeds, The eight great attainments, And the highest spiritual goal of all-- The unsurpassable.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS04PrayerBook\", \"acip\": \",H'Um ZAG MED YE SHES BDUD RTZIR BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,BDE BA CHEN PO'I TSOGS KYI MCHOD PA 'DI, ,RDO RJE 'CHANG DBANG BLO BZANG GRAGS PA DANG, ,DBYER MED RIGS KYI COD PAN DRIN CAN RJE, ,RTZA BA BRGYUD PA'I BLA MA RNAMS LA 'BUL, ,DGYES SHING BZHES NAS SGRUB MCHOG BDAG CAG LA, ,'PHRIN LAS RNAM BZHI GRUB PA CHEN PO BRGYAD, ,BLA MED MCHOG GI DNGOS GRUB STZAL DU GSOL,\", \"wylie\": \"hUM zag med ye shes bdud rtsir byin brlabs pa'i, ,bde ba chen po'i tshogs kyi mchod pa 'di, ,rdo rje 'chang dbang blo bzang grags pa dang, ,dbyer med rigs kyi cod pan drin can rje, ,rtsa ba brgyud pa'i bla ma rnams la 'bul, ,dgyes shing bzhes nas sgrub mchog bdag cag la, ,'phrin las rnam bzhi grub pa chen po brgyad, ,bla med mchog gi dngos grub stsal du gsol\", \"english\": \"Hung! Here is the Offering of the Gathering, Ecstasy itself, Blessed and become the nectar of deathlessness, Immaculate understanding. And we offer it to To our root and lineage Lamas: To You of greatest kindness, Crowning jewels of Enlightened Kind, Completely indivisible From the Keeper of the Diamond-- Lobsang Drakpa himself. Be pleased, we beg You, With our gift, and accept it from us. For we are high practitioners, And we ask that You grant us The power of the four mighty deeds, The eight great attainments, And the highest spiritual goal of all-- The unsurpassable.\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 11590,
        "course": "TCS04PrayerBook",
        "seq": 251,
        "acip": ",H'Um ZAG MED YE SHES BDUD RTZIR BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,BDE BA CHEN PO'I TSOGS KYI MCHOD PA 'DI, ,DPAL LDAN RDO RJE 'JIGS BYED GSHID RJE'I GSHED, ,DUS 'KHOR GSANG BDE DGYES PA RDO RJE SOGS, ,YI DAM ZHI KHRO RAB 'BYAMS RNAMS LA 'BUL, ,DGYES SHING BZHES NAS SGRUB MCHOG BDAG CAG LA, ,'PHRIN LAS RNAM BZHI GRUB PA CHEN PO BRGYAD, ,BLA MED MCHOG GI DNGOS GRUB STZAL DU GSOL,",
        "wylie": "hUM zag med ye shes bdud rtsir byin brlabs pa'i, ,bde ba chen po'i tshogs kyi mchod pa 'di, ,dpal ldan rdo rje 'jigs byed gshid rje'i gshed, ,dus 'khor gsang bde dgyes pa rdo rje sogs, ,yi dam zhi khro rab 'byams rnams la 'bul, ,dgyes shing bzhes nas sgrub mchog bdag cag la, ,'phrin las rnam bzhi grub pa chen po brgyad, ,bla med mchog gi dngos grub stsal du gsol",
        "english": "Hung! Here is the Offering of the Gathering, Ecstasy itself, Blessed and become the nectar of deathlessness, Immaculate understanding. And we offer it To the glorious Diamond Lord of Terror, To the Slayer of the Lord of Death; And to all the millions of Close Angels, Peaceful ones and wrathful too: To those who count among Their number The Wheel of Time; the Secret Collection; Highest Bliss and the Diamond of Pleasure. Be pleased, we beg You, With our gift, and accept it from us. For we are high practitioners, And we ask that You grant us The power of the four mighty deeds, The eight great attainments, And the highest spiritual goal of all-- The unsurpassable.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS04PrayerBook\", \"acip\": \",H'Um ZAG MED YE SHES BDUD RTZIR BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,BDE BA CHEN PO'I TSOGS KYI MCHOD PA 'DI, ,DPAL LDAN RDO RJE 'JIGS BYED GSHID RJE'I GSHED, ,DUS 'KHOR GSANG BDE DGYES PA RDO RJE SOGS, ,YI DAM ZHI KHRO RAB 'BYAMS RNAMS LA 'BUL, ,DGYES SHING BZHES NAS SGRUB MCHOG BDAG CAG LA, ,'PHRIN LAS RNAM BZHI GRUB PA CHEN PO BRGYAD, ,BLA MED MCHOG GI DNGOS GRUB STZAL DU GSOL,\", \"wylie\": \"hUM zag med ye shes bdud rtsir byin brlabs pa'i, ,bde ba chen po'i tshogs kyi mchod pa 'di, ,dpal ldan rdo rje 'jigs byed gshid rje'i gshed, ,dus 'khor gsang bde dgyes pa rdo rje sogs, ,yi dam zhi khro rab 'byams rnams la 'bul, ,dgyes shing bzhes nas sgrub mchog bdag cag la, ,'phrin las rnam bzhi grub pa chen po brgyad, ,bla med mchog gi dngos grub stsal du gsol\", \"english\": \"Hung! Here is the Offering of the Gathering, Ecstasy itself, Blessed and become the nectar of deathlessness, Immaculate understanding. And we offer it To the glorious Diamond Lord of Terror, To the Slayer of the Lord of Death; And to all the millions of Close Angels, Peaceful ones and wrathful too: To those who count among Their number The Wheel of Time; the Secret Collection; Highest Bliss and the Diamond of Pleasure. Be pleased, we beg You, With our gift, and accept it from us. For we are high practitioners, And we ask that You grant us The power of the four mighty deeds, The eight great attainments, And the highest spiritual goal of all-- The unsurpassable.\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 11591,
        "course": "TCS04PrayerBook",
        "seq": 252,
        "acip": ",H'Um ZAG MED YE SHES BDUD RTZIR BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,BDE BA CHEN PO'I TSOGS KYI MCHOD PA 'DI, ,DUS GSUM BDE GSHEGS DAM CHOS 'PHAGS TSOGS BCAS, ,BSLU MED DKON MCHOG RIN CHEN MA LUS DANG, ,KHYAD PAR DPA' BO MKHA' 'GRO'I TSOGS LA 'BUL, ,DGYES SHING BZHES NAS SGRUB MCHOG BDAG CAG LA, ,'PHRIN LAS RNAM BZHI GRUB PA CHEN PO BRGYAD, ,BLA MED MCHOG GI DNGOS GRUB STZAL DU GSOL,",
        "wylie": "hUM zag med ye shes bdud rtsir byin brlabs pa'i, ,bde ba chen po'i tshogs kyi mchod pa 'di, ,dus gsum bde gshegs dam chos 'phags tshogs bcas, ,bslu med dkon mchog rin chen ma lus dang, ,khyad par dpa' bo mkha' 'gro'i tshogs la 'bul, ,dgyes shing bzhes nas sgrub mchog bdag cag la, ,'phrin las rnam bzhi grub pa chen po brgyad, ,bla med mchog gi dngos grub stsal du gsol",
        "english": "Hung! Here is the Offering of the Gathering, Ecstasy itself, Blessed and become the nectar of deathlessness, Immaculate understanding. And we offer it To Those Who Have Gone to Bliss Before, or now, or in time to come; And to the highest Dharma, And the Community of beings Who have already seen the void; We offer it to all of You Jewels, Precious and supreme, Who cannot ever fail us. And most especially we offer this To the crowds of Warriors And Ladies who travel the sky. Be pleased, we beg You, With our gift, and accept it from us. For we are high practitioners, And we ask that You grant us The power of the four mighty deeds, The eight great attainments, And the highest spiritual goal of all-- The unsurpassable.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS04PrayerBook\", \"acip\": \",H'Um ZAG MED YE SHES BDUD RTZIR BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,BDE BA CHEN PO'I TSOGS KYI MCHOD PA 'DI, ,DUS GSUM BDE GSHEGS DAM CHOS 'PHAGS TSOGS BCAS, ,BSLU MED DKON MCHOG RIN CHEN MA LUS DANG, ,KHYAD PAR DPA' BO MKHA' 'GRO'I TSOGS LA 'BUL, ,DGYES SHING BZHES NAS SGRUB MCHOG BDAG CAG LA, ,'PHRIN LAS RNAM BZHI GRUB PA CHEN PO BRGYAD, ,BLA MED MCHOG GI DNGOS GRUB STZAL DU GSOL,\", \"wylie\": \"hUM zag med ye shes bdud rtsir byin brlabs pa'i, ,bde ba chen po'i tshogs kyi mchod pa 'di, ,dus gsum bde gshegs dam chos 'phags tshogs bcas, ,bslu med dkon mchog rin chen ma lus dang, ,khyad par dpa' bo mkha' 'gro'i tshogs la 'bul, ,dgyes shing bzhes nas sgrub mchog bdag cag la, ,'phrin las rnam bzhi grub pa chen po brgyad, ,bla med mchog gi dngos grub stsal du gsol\", \"english\": \"Hung! Here is the Offering of the Gathering, Ecstasy itself, Blessed and become the nectar of deathlessness, Immaculate understanding. And we offer it To Those Who Have Gone to Bliss Before, or now, or in time to come; And to the highest Dharma, And the Community of beings Who have already seen the void; We offer it to all of You Jewels, Precious and supreme, Who cannot ever fail us. And most especially we offer this To the crowds of Warriors And Ladies who travel the sky. Be pleased, we beg You, With our gift, and accept it from us. For we are high practitioners, And we ask that You grant us The power of the four mighty deeds, The eight great attainments, And the highest spiritual goal of all-- The unsurpassable.\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 11592,
        "course": "TCS04PrayerBook",
        "seq": 253,
        "acip": ",H'Um ZAG MED YE SHES BDUD RTZIR BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,BDE BA CHEN PO'I TSOGS KYI MCHOD PA 'DI, ,PHYAG DRUG CHOS RGYAL 'DOD KHAMS DBANG PHYUG MA, ,ZHAL BZHI RGYAL CHEN DREGS PA LCAM SRING SOGS, ,MA LUS CHOS SKYONG BSRUNG MA'I TSOGS LA 'BUL, ,DGYES SHING BZHES NAS SGRUB MCHOG BDAG CAG LA, ,'PHRIN LAS RNAM BZHI GRUB PA CHEN PO BRGYAD, ,BLA MED MCHOG GI DNGOS GRUB STZAL DU GSOL,",
        "wylie": "hUM zag med ye shes bdud rtsir byin brlabs pa'i, ,bde ba chen po'i tshogs kyi mchod pa 'di, ,phyag drug chos rgyal 'dod khams dbang phyug ma, ,zhal bzhi rgyal chen dregs pa lcam sring sogs, ,ma lus chos skyong bsrung ma'i tshogs la 'bul, ,dgyes shing bzhes nas sgrub mchog bdag cag la, ,'phrin las rnam bzhi grub pa chen po brgyad, ,bla med mchog gi dngos grub stsal du gsol",
        "english": "Hung! Here is the Offering of the Gathering, Ecstasy itself, Blessed and become the nectar of deathlessness, Immaculate understanding. And we offer it To the Six-Armed One, To the King of All Things, To the Empress of the Desire Realm, To the Four-Faced One, the Great King, The Arrogant One, and the Queen of Witches; To all the Guardians of the Dharma, To all the Ladies who keep it safe. Be pleased, we beg You, With our gift, and accept it from us. For we are high practitioners, And we ask that You grant us The power of the four mighty deeds, The eight great attainments, And the highest spiritual goal of all-- The unsurpassable.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS04PrayerBook\", \"acip\": \",H'Um ZAG MED YE SHES BDUD RTZIR BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,BDE BA CHEN PO'I TSOGS KYI MCHOD PA 'DI, ,PHYAG DRUG CHOS RGYAL 'DOD KHAMS DBANG PHYUG MA, ,ZHAL BZHI RGYAL CHEN DREGS PA LCAM SRING SOGS, ,MA LUS CHOS SKYONG BSRUNG MA'I TSOGS LA 'BUL, ,DGYES SHING BZHES NAS SGRUB MCHOG BDAG CAG LA, ,'PHRIN LAS RNAM BZHI GRUB PA CHEN PO BRGYAD, ,BLA MED MCHOG GI DNGOS GRUB STZAL DU GSOL,\", \"wylie\": \"hUM zag med ye shes bdud rtsir byin brlabs pa'i, ,bde ba chen po'i tshogs kyi mchod pa 'di, ,phyag drug chos rgyal 'dod khams dbang phyug ma, ,zhal bzhi rgyal chen dregs pa lcam sring sogs, ,ma lus chos skyong bsrung ma'i tshogs la 'bul, ,dgyes shing bzhes nas sgrub mchog bdag cag la, ,'phrin las rnam bzhi grub pa chen po brgyad, ,bla med mchog gi dngos grub stsal du gsol\", \"english\": \"Hung! Here is the Offering of the Gathering, Ecstasy itself, Blessed and become the nectar of deathlessness, Immaculate understanding. And we offer it To the Six-Armed One, To the King of All Things, To the Empress of the Desire Realm, To the Four-Faced One, the Great King, The Arrogant One, and the Queen of Witches; To all the Guardians of the Dharma, To all the Ladies who keep it safe. Be pleased, we beg You, With our gift, and accept it from us. For we are high practitioners, And we ask that You grant us The power of the four mighty deeds, The eight great attainments, And the highest spiritual goal of all-- The unsurpassable.\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 11593,
        "course": "TCS04PrayerBook",
        "seq": 254,
        "acip": ",H'Um ZAG MED YE SHES BDUD RTZIR BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,BDE BA CHEN PO'I TSOGS KYI MCHOD PA 'DI, ,PHYOGS SKYONG ZHING SKYONG DREGS PA SDE BRGYAD DANG, ,TSE RING MCHED LNGA BSTAN MA BCU GNYIS SOGS, ,YUL LHA GZHI BDAG 'KHOR DANG BCAS LA 'BUL, ,DGYES SHING BZHES NAS SGRUB MCHOG BDAG CAG LA, ,SPYOD LAM RNAM BZHI BYA BA CI BYED KYANG, ,KUN SLONG RU NGA PHRAG DOG MA BYED PAR, ,'GAL RKYEN KUN GSOL MTHUN RKYEN MA LUS SGRUBS,",
        "wylie": "hUM zag med ye shes bdud rtsir byin brlabs pa'i, ,bde ba chen po'i tshogs kyi mchod pa 'di, ,phyogs skyong zhing skyong dregs pa sde brgyad dang, ,tshe ring mched lnga bstan ma bcu gnyis sogs, ,yul lha gzhi bdag 'khor dang bcas la 'bul, ,dgyes shing bzhes nas sgrub mchog bdag cag la, ,spyod lam rnam bzhi bya ba ci byed kyang, ,kun slong ru nga phrag dog ma byed par, ,'gal rkyen kun gsol mthun rkyen ma lus sgrubs",
        "english": "Hung! Here is the Offering of the Gathering, Ecstasy itself, Blessed and become the nectar of deathlessness, Immaculate understanding. And we offer it To the Guardians of the Ten Directions, The Protectors of the Holy Lands, The Eight Great Forces of Arroganze, The Five Mighty Sisters who grant long life, The Band of the Twelve Protectors, And to all their like. We offier to the spirits of power Who live in our land, And to the lord of all the spirits Who make this very place their home. Be pleased, we beg You, With our gift, and accept it from us. For we are high practitioners, And regardless of how we seem to act, In each of the four different modes, You need not think of us With thoughts of envy or possessiveness. Come instead and work with us: Help to clear away Anything that could hinder us; Help us gather together All the things we need to succeed.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS04PrayerBook\", \"acip\": \",H'Um ZAG MED YE SHES BDUD RTZIR BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,BDE BA CHEN PO'I TSOGS KYI MCHOD PA 'DI, ,PHYOGS SKYONG ZHING SKYONG DREGS PA SDE BRGYAD DANG, ,TSE RING MCHED LNGA BSTAN MA BCU GNYIS SOGS, ,YUL LHA GZHI BDAG 'KHOR DANG BCAS LA 'BUL, ,DGYES SHING BZHES NAS SGRUB MCHOG BDAG CAG LA, ,SPYOD LAM RNAM BZHI BYA BA CI BYED KYANG, ,KUN SLONG RU NGA PHRAG DOG MA BYED PAR, ,'GAL RKYEN KUN GSOL MTHUN RKYEN MA LUS SGRUBS,\", \"wylie\": \"hUM zag med ye shes bdud rtsir byin brlabs pa'i, ,bde ba chen po'i tshogs kyi mchod pa 'di, ,phyogs skyong zhing skyong dregs pa sde brgyad dang, ,tshe ring mched lnga bstan ma bcu gnyis sogs, ,yul lha gzhi bdag 'khor dang bcas la 'bul, ,dgyes shing bzhes nas sgrub mchog bdag cag la, ,spyod lam rnam bzhi bya ba ci byed kyang, ,kun slong ru nga phrag dog ma byed par, ,'gal rkyen kun gsol mthun rkyen ma lus sgrubs\", \"english\": \"Hung! Here is the Offering of the Gathering, Ecstasy itself, Blessed and become the nectar of deathlessness, Immaculate understanding. And we offer it To the Guardians of the Ten Directions, The Protectors of the Holy Lands, The Eight Great Forces of Arroganze, The Five Mighty Sisters who grant long life, The Band of the Twelve Protectors, And to all their like. We offier to the spirits of power Who live in our land, And to the lord of all the spirits Who make this very place their home. Be pleased, we beg You, With our gift, and accept it from us. For we are high practitioners, And regardless of how we seem to act, In each of the four different modes, You need not think of us With thoughts of envy or possessiveness. Come instead and work with us: Help to clear away Anything that could hinder us; Help us gather together All the things we need to succeed.\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 11876,
        "course": "TCS05",
        "seq": 197,
        "acip": "RANG BDE MCHOG DANG RIG MA PHAG MOR BSKYED PA LUS LHA'I 'DU SHES DANG , GNYIS KA'I MKHA' GSANG BYIN GYIS BRLABS NAS YI GE BKOD PA SNGAGS KYI 'DU SHES DANG , THABS 'DI LA BRTEN NAS ZAG MED KYI BDE BA MNGON DU BYA'O SNYAM PA'I CHOS KYI 'DU SHES TE 'DU SHES GSUM DANG LDAN PAS SNYOMS 'JUG BYA,",
        "wylie": "rang bde mchog dang rig ma phag mor bskyed pa lus lha'i 'du shes dang , gnyis ka'i mkha' gsang byin gyis brlabs nas yi ge bkod pa sngags kyi 'du shes dang , thabs 'di la brten nas zag med kyi bde ba mngon du bya'o snyam pa'i chos kyi 'du shes te 'du shes gsum dang ldan pas snyoms 'jug bya",
        "english": "The practice of union must be performed with three different conceptions.  First, we must conceive of ourselves as the Angel named Highest Bliss, and our Woman of Knowledge as the Sow.  This is called \"the conception of our body as the Angel.\" Secondly, we must bless the sky and the secret, placing the secret syllables.  This is called the \"conception of the mantra.\"  Finally, we must have the \"conception of the Dharma,\" which means that we think to ourselves, \"By using this method, I will be able to bring about the bliss of the immaculate.\" *** Returning to Geshe Tsewang Samdrup:",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS05\", \"acip\": \"RANG BDE MCHOG DANG RIG MA PHAG MOR BSKYED PA LUS LHA'I 'DU SHES DANG , GNYIS KA'I MKHA' GSANG BYIN GYIS BRLABS NAS YI GE BKOD PA SNGAGS KYI 'DU SHES DANG , THABS 'DI LA BRTEN NAS ZAG MED KYI BDE BA MNGON DU BYA'O SNYAM PA'I CHOS KYI 'DU SHES TE 'DU SHES GSUM DANG LDAN PAS SNYOMS 'JUG BYA,\", \"wylie\": \"rang bde mchog dang rig ma phag mor bskyed pa lus lha'i 'du shes dang , gnyis ka'i mkha' gsang byin gyis brlabs nas yi ge bkod pa sngags kyi 'du shes dang , thabs 'di la brten nas zag med kyi bde ba mngon du bya'o snyam pa'i chos kyi 'du shes te 'du shes gsum dang ldan pas snyoms 'jug bya\", \"english\": \"The practice of union must be performed with three different conceptions.  First, we must conceive of ourselves as the Angel named Highest Bliss, and our Woman of Knowledge as the Sow.  This is called \\\"the conception of our body as the Angel.\\\" Secondly, we must bless the sky and the secret, placing the secret syllables.  This is called the \\\"conception of the mantra.\\\"  Finally, we must have the \\\"conception of the Dharma,\\\" which means that we think to ourselves, \\\"By using this method, I will be able to bring about the bliss of the immaculate.\\\" *** Returning to Geshe Tsewang Samdrup:\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 12751,
        "course": "TCS06",
        "seq": 568,
        "acip": "RDO RJE'I RTZE MO NAS GTZUG TOR GYI 'KHOR LO RDZOGS PA'I BAR DU KHAMS DKAR PO'I THIG LE NYI KHRI CHIG STONG DRUG BRGYA GONG NAS GONG DU YAR BRTZEGS PA'I TSE, GTZUG TOR NAS RDO RJE'I RTZE MO'I BAR DU KHAMS DMAR PO'I THIG LE NYI KHRI CHIG STONG DRUG BRGYA 'OG NAS 'OG TU MAR 'BAB PAR GSUNGS SHING , DE LTAR KHAMS DKAR DMAR 'DZAG MED DU BCINGS PAS MI 'GYUR BA'I BDE BA NYI KHRI CHIG STONG DRUG BRGYA RDZOGS PA NA KHAMS DKAR DMAR GNYIS KYANG MED PAR 'GYUR TE,",
        "wylie": "rdo rje'i rtse mo nas gtsug tor gyi 'khor lo rdzogs pa'i bar du khams dkar po'i thig le nyi khri chig stong drug brgya gong nas gong du yar brtsegs pa'i tshe, gtsug tor nas rdo rje'i rtse mo'i bar du khams dmar po'i thig le nyi khri chig stong drug brgya 'og nas 'og tu mar 'bab par gsungs shing , de ltar khams dkar dmar 'dzag med du bcings pas mi 'gyur ba'i bde ba nyi khri chig stong drug brgya rdzogs pa na khams dkar dmar gnyis kyang med par 'gyur te",
        "english": "We pile up then 21,600 different drops of white element as we move higher and higher from the tip of the diamond all the way up to the chakra at the tip of the head.  It is stated that, when this is done, then 21,600 different drops of the red element drop further and further down, moving from the tip of the head to the tip of the diamond.  When we have gone this way through 21,600 different moments of immutable bliss with the white and red elements, locking them in so that they don't ooze out, then even these too--the white and red elements--also disappear.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS06\", \"acip\": \"RDO RJE'I RTZE MO NAS GTZUG TOR GYI 'KHOR LO RDZOGS PA'I BAR DU KHAMS DKAR PO'I THIG LE NYI KHRI CHIG STONG DRUG BRGYA GONG NAS GONG DU YAR BRTZEGS PA'I TSE, GTZUG TOR NAS RDO RJE'I RTZE MO'I BAR DU KHAMS DMAR PO'I THIG LE NYI KHRI CHIG STONG DRUG BRGYA 'OG NAS 'OG TU MAR 'BAB PAR GSUNGS SHING , DE LTAR KHAMS DKAR DMAR 'DZAG MED DU BCINGS PAS MI 'GYUR BA'I BDE BA NYI KHRI CHIG STONG DRUG BRGYA RDZOGS PA NA KHAMS DKAR DMAR GNYIS KYANG MED PAR 'GYUR TE,\", \"wylie\": \"rdo rje'i rtse mo nas gtsug tor gyi 'khor lo rdzogs pa'i bar du khams dkar po'i thig le nyi khri chig stong drug brgya gong nas gong du yar brtsegs pa'i tshe, gtsug tor nas rdo rje'i rtse mo'i bar du khams dmar po'i thig le nyi khri chig stong drug brgya 'og nas 'og tu mar 'bab par gsungs shing , de ltar khams dkar dmar 'dzag med du bcings pas mi 'gyur ba'i bde ba nyi khri chig stong drug brgya rdzogs pa na khams dkar dmar gnyis kyang med par 'gyur te\", \"english\": \"We pile up then 21,600 different drops of white element as we move higher and higher from the tip of the diamond all the way up to the chakra at the tip of the head.  It is stated that, when this is done, then 21,600 different drops of the red element drop further and further down, moving from the tip of the head to the tip of the diamond.  When we have gone this way through 21,600 different moments of immutable bliss with the white and red elements, locking them in so that they don't ooze out, then even these too--the white and red elements--also disappear.\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 12752,
        "course": "TCS06",
        "seq": 569,
        "acip": "SNGAGS RIM LAS, BYANG CHUB KYI SEMS LUS LA 'DZAG MED DU BCINGS PAS MI 'GYUR BA'I BDE BA RDZOGS PA NA BEMS PO'I KHAMS THAMS CAD ZAD PAR 'GYUR BAS KHU BA NYID KYANG MI GNAS TE, ZHES PA NAS, DES NA STONG GZUGS KYI RDO RJE'I SKUR 'JA' TSON BZHIN DU SONG BA LA GROD PA 'O MAS BKANG BA BZHIN DU MA 'DZIN CIG ,CES GSUNGS PA'I PHYIR RO,,",
        "wylie": "sngags rim las, byang chub kyi sems lus la 'dzag med du bcings pas mi 'gyur ba'i bde ba rdzogs pa na bems po'i khams thams cad zad par 'gyur bas khu ba nyid kyang mi gnas te, zhes pa nas, des na stong gzugs kyi rdo rje'i skur 'ja' tshon bzhin du song ba la grod pa 'o mas bkang ba bzhin du ma 'dzin cig ,ces gsungs pa'i phyir ro",
        "english": "And this is true because of the section from the Steps on the Way of the Secret Word which begins with-- Suppose that we are able to lock the element of enlightenment into the body, so that it doesn't ooze out.  Our experience of immutable bliss then will be complete, and all the different parts of the material body will be put to an end.  When this happens, not even the semen itself then can remain. And continues up to-- We go then into the diamond body of empty form--something like a rainbow.  You shouldn't think though that the body just fills up the way an udder does with milk. [Translator's note: The 'DZAD MED of the original carving for 'DZAG MED here is an error; see the ACIP digital version, S5281, folio 394a.]",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS06\", \"acip\": \"SNGAGS RIM LAS, BYANG CHUB KYI SEMS LUS LA 'DZAG MED DU BCINGS PAS MI 'GYUR BA'I BDE BA RDZOGS PA NA BEMS PO'I KHAMS THAMS CAD ZAD PAR 'GYUR BAS KHU BA NYID KYANG MI GNAS TE, ZHES PA NAS, DES NA STONG GZUGS KYI RDO RJE'I SKUR 'JA' TSON BZHIN DU SONG BA LA GROD PA 'O MAS BKANG BA BZHIN DU MA 'DZIN CIG ,CES GSUNGS PA'I PHYIR RO,,\", \"wylie\": \"sngags rim las, byang chub kyi sems lus la 'dzag med du bcings pas mi 'gyur ba'i bde ba rdzogs pa na bems po'i khams thams cad zad par 'gyur bas khu ba nyid kyang mi gnas te, zhes pa nas, des na stong gzugs kyi rdo rje'i skur 'ja' tshon bzhin du song ba la grod pa 'o mas bkang ba bzhin du ma 'dzin cig ,ces gsungs pa'i phyir ro\", \"english\": \"And this is true because of the section from the Steps on the Way of the Secret Word which begins with-- Suppose that we are able to lock the element of enlightenment into the body, so that it doesn't ooze out.  Our experience of immutable bliss then will be complete, and all the different parts of the material body will be put to an end.  When this happens, not even the semen itself then can remain. And continues up to-- We go then into the diamond body of empty form--something like a rainbow.  You shouldn't think though that the body just fills up the way an udder does with milk. [Translator's note: The 'DZAD MED of the original carving for 'DZAG MED here is an error; see the ACIP digital version, S5281, folio 394a.]\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 12766,
        "course": "TCS06",
        "seq": 583,
        "acip": "DES NA SKU DE 'GRUB PA LA RDUL PHRA RAB TSOGS PA'I LUS NYAMS PAR BYA DGOS PAS, DE NI GSER 'GYUR GYI RTZIS LCAGS GSER DU BSGYUR BA BZHIN DU LUS LA BYANG CHUB KYI SEMS 'DZAG MED DU BCINGS PAS BEMS PO'I KHAMS RNAMS ZAD PAR BYED DE,",
        "wylie": "des na sku de 'grub pa la rdul phra rab tshogs pa'i lus nyams par bya dgos pas, de ni gser 'gyur gyi rtsis lcags gser du bsgyur ba bzhin du lus la byang chub kyi sems 'dzag med du bcings pas bems po'i khams rnams zad par byed de",
        "english": "It is though true that--in order to reach this holy body--the body which is composed of aggregates of atoms must be made to disappear.  As such, we must lock the element of enlightenment within the body, preventing it from oozing out.  This then can act like the alchemical elixir which turns iron into gold.  It brings all the various material parts of us to an end.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS06\", \"acip\": \"DES NA SKU DE 'GRUB PA LA RDUL PHRA RAB TSOGS PA'I LUS NYAMS PAR BYA DGOS PAS, DE NI GSER 'GYUR GYI RTZIS LCAGS GSER DU BSGYUR BA BZHIN DU LUS LA BYANG CHUB KYI SEMS 'DZAG MED DU BCINGS PAS BEMS PO'I KHAMS RNAMS ZAD PAR BYED DE,\", \"wylie\": \"des na sku de 'grub pa la rdul phra rab tshogs pa'i lus nyams par bya dgos pas, de ni gser 'gyur gyi rtsis lcags gser du bsgyur ba bzhin du lus la byang chub kyi sems 'dzag med du bcings pas bems po'i khams rnams zad par byed de\", \"english\": \"It is though true that--in order to reach this holy body--the body which is composed of aggregates of atoms must be made to disappear.  As such, we must lock the element of enlightenment within the body, preventing it from oozing out.  This then can act like the alchemical elixir which turns iron into gold.  It brings all the various material parts of us to an end.\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 12854,
        "course": "TCS07",
        "seq": 68,
        "acip": ",KUN LA PHUL BAS ZAG MED BDE BAS TSIM, ,SEMS CAN RNAMS KYANG SGRIB BRAL CHOS SKU THOB, ,MCHOD PA'I 'KHOR GSUM SMRA BSAM BRJOD 'DAS KYI, ,BDE STONG GNYIS SU MED PA'I NGO BOR GYUR, CES DANG ,",
        "wylie": "kun la phul bas zag med bde bas tshim, ,sems can rnams kyang sgrib bral chos sku thob, ,mchod pa'i 'khor gsum smra bsam brjod 'das kyi, ,bde stong gnyis su med pa'i ngo bor gyur, ces dang",
        "english": "We offer this then to You all; May You be filled With immaculate bliss. And may every living being Be freed from every obstacle, Achieving the body Of ultimate truth. May the three parts Of our offering Transform into indivisible Bliss and voidness, Beyond all words to tell.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS07\", \"acip\": \",KUN LA PHUL BAS ZAG MED BDE BAS TSIM, ,SEMS CAN RNAMS KYANG SGRIB BRAL CHOS SKU THOB, ,MCHOD PA'I 'KHOR GSUM SMRA BSAM BRJOD 'DAS KYI, ,BDE STONG GNYIS SU MED PA'I NGO BOR GYUR, CES DANG ,\", \"wylie\": \"kun la phul bas zag med bde bas tshim, ,sems can rnams kyang sgrib bral chos sku thob, ,mchod pa'i 'khor gsum smra bsam brjod 'das kyi, ,bde stong gnyis su med pa'i ngo bor gyur, ces dang\", \"english\": \"We offer this then to You all; May You be filled With immaculate bliss. And may every living being Be freed from every obstacle, Achieving the body Of ultimate truth. May the three parts Of our offering Transform into indivisible Bliss and voidness, Beyond all words to tell.\", \"repair_wave\": \"tcs-v25\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 13742,
        "course": "TCS08PabongkaSadhana",
        "seq": 4,
        "acip": ",ZAG MED BDE BA MCHOG GI DKYIL 'KHOR DU, ,STONG DANG SPROS KUN SDOM MKHAS HE RU KA ,DPAL LDAN DPA' BO'I DBANG PHYUG YAB YUM GYIS, ,RTAG TU MI SHIGS THIG LER DGYES DGUR ROL,",
        "wylie": "zag med bde ba mchog gi dkyil 'khor du, ,stong dang spros kun sdom mkhas he ru ka ,dpal ldan dpa' bo'i dbang phyug yab yum gyis, ,rtag tu mi shigs thig ler dgyes dgur rol",
        "english": "Man and Woman, Lords of the Warriors, Glorious, Heruka, Master of emptiness, Stopping all projections, Reveling, forever, In the thousand pleasures Of the indestructible drop.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS08PabongkaSadhana\", \"acip\": \",ZAG MED BDE BA MCHOG GI DKYIL 'KHOR DU, ,STONG DANG SPROS KUN SDOM MKHAS HE RU KA ,DPAL LDAN DPA' BO'I DBANG PHYUG YAB YUM GYIS, ,RTAG TU MI SHIGS THIG LER DGYES DGUR ROL,\", \"wylie\": \"zag med bde ba mchog gi dkyil 'khor du, ,stong dang spros kun sdom mkhas he ru ka ,dpal ldan dpa' bo'i dbang phyug yab yum gyis, ,rtag tu mi shigs thig ler dgyes dgur rol\", \"english\": \"Man and Woman, Lords of the Warriors, Glorious, Heruka, Master of emptiness, Stopping all projections, Reveling, forever, In the thousand pleasures Of the indestructible drop.\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 13823,
        "course": "TCS08PabongkaSadhana",
        "seq": 85,
        "acip": "(GIS NANG MCHOD 'BUL, RANG GI THUGS KA NAS PADMA CAN LA SOGS PA'I RIG MA DPAG TU MED PA SPROS PA RNAMS RDO RJE RNAL 'BYOR MA'I SKUR GYUR PA DANG BLA MA YAB YUM SNYOMS PAR ZHUGS PAS ZAG MED KYI BDE BAS KHYAB PAR BSAMS LA,)",
        "wylie": "(gis nang mchod 'bul, rang gi thugs ka nas padma can la sogs pa'i rig ma dpag tu med pa spros pa rnams rdo rje rnal 'byor ma'i skur gyur pa dang bla ma yab yum snyoms par zhugs pas zag med kyi bde bas khyab par bsams la,)",
        "english": "(Imagine now that from your heart you send forth countless Enlightened Women, those like the Lady of the Lotus.  They turn into the Angel of Diamond, and they sit in the meditation of men and women with the Lamas.  They are covered with immaculate bliss:)",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS08PabongkaSadhana\", \"acip\": \"(GIS NANG MCHOD 'BUL, RANG GI THUGS KA NAS PADMA CAN LA SOGS PA'I RIG MA DPAG TU MED PA SPROS PA RNAMS RDO RJE RNAL 'BYOR MA'I SKUR GYUR PA DANG BLA MA YAB YUM SNYOMS PAR ZHUGS PAS ZAG MED KYI BDE BAS KHYAB PAR BSAMS LA,)\", \"wylie\": \"(gis nang mchod 'bul, rang gi thugs ka nas padma can la sogs pa'i rig ma dpag tu med pa spros pa rnams rdo rje rnal 'byor ma'i skur gyur pa dang bla ma yab yum snyoms par zhugs pas zag med kyi bde bas khyab par bsams la,)\", \"english\": \"(Imagine now that from your heart you send forth countless Enlightened Women, those like the Lady of the Lotus.  They turn into the Angel of Diamond, and they sit in the meditation of men and women with the Lamas.  They are covered with immaculate bliss:)\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 13844,
        "course": "TCS08PabongkaSadhana",
        "seq": 106,
        "acip": ",PHUL BAS MGRON KUN ZAG MED BDE BAS TSIM, ,SEMS CAN RNAMS KYANG SGRIB BRAL CHOS SKU THOB, ,MCHOD PA'I 'KHOR GSUM SMRA BSAM BRJOD 'DAS KYI, ,BDE STONG GNYIS SU MED PA'I NGO BOR GYUR,",
        "wylie": "phul bas mgron kun zag med bde bas tshim, ,sems can rnams kyang sgrib bral chos sku thob, ,mchod pa'i 'khor gsum smra bsam brjod 'das kyi, ,bde stong gnyis su med pa'i ngo bor gyur",
        "english": "pulwe drunkun sakme dewe tsim semchen namkyang dripdrel chuku top chupay korsum masam jude kyi detong nyisu mepay ngowar gyur As I offer Them the nectar, Every Guest is filled With immaculate happiness; Every living being too Achieves the Body of the Dharma. All three parts Of the offering Change in nature, Becoming bliss and emptiness, Two things one, Beyond all words or thought.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS08PabongkaSadhana\", \"acip\": \",PHUL BAS MGRON KUN ZAG MED BDE BAS TSIM, ,SEMS CAN RNAMS KYANG SGRIB BRAL CHOS SKU THOB, ,MCHOD PA'I 'KHOR GSUM SMRA BSAM BRJOD 'DAS KYI, ,BDE STONG GNYIS SU MED PA'I NGO BOR GYUR,\", \"wylie\": \"phul bas mgron kun zag med bde bas tshim, ,sems can rnams kyang sgrib bral chos sku thob, ,mchod pa'i 'khor gsum smra bsam brjod 'das kyi, ,bde stong gnyis su med pa'i ngo bor gyur\", \"english\": \"pulwe drunkun sakme dewe tsim semchen namkyang dripdrel chuku top chupay korsum masam jude kyi detong nyisu mepay ngowar gyur As I offer Them the nectar, Every Guest is filled With immaculate happiness; Every living being too Achieves the Body of the Dharma. All three parts Of the offering Change in nature, Becoming bliss and emptiness, Two things one, Beyond all words or thought.\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 14129,
        "course": "TCS08PabongkaSadhana",
        "seq": 391,
        "acip": ",HO, ,TING 'DZIN SNGAGS DANG PHYAG RGYAS BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,ZAG MED BDUD RTZI'I TSOGS MCHOD RGYA MTSO 'DI, ,RTZA BRGYUD BLA MA'I TSOGS RNAMS MNYES PHYIR 'BUL, ,AOm A'A: H'Um, ,'DOD DGU'I DPAL LA ROL PAS TSIMS MDZAD NAS, ,AE MA HO, ,BYIN RLABS CHAR CHEN DBAB TU GSOL,",
        "wylie": "ho, ,ting 'dzin sngags dang phyag rgyas byin brlabs pa'i, ,zag med bdud rtsi'i tshogs mchod rgya mtsho 'di, ,rtsa brgyud bla ma'i tshogs rnams mnyes phyir 'bul, ,aoM a'a: hUM, ,'dod dgu'i dpal la rol pas tshims mdzad nas, ,ae ma ho, ,byin rlabs char chen dbab tu gsol",
        "english": "Ho! We offer this ocean Of gifts of the Gathering, Immaculate nectar Blessed by our concentration, By our secret words, And by our secret signs, To the gathering Of all our root and lineage Lamas; May You be pleased. Om ah hung, Take Your fill, Revel in these thousand Objects of the senses; Eh ma ho, Send down on us A great rain of Your blessings.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS08PabongkaSadhana\", \"acip\": \",HO, ,TING 'DZIN SNGAGS DANG PHYAG RGYAS BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,ZAG MED BDUD RTZI'I TSOGS MCHOD RGYA MTSO 'DI, ,RTZA BRGYUD BLA MA'I TSOGS RNAMS MNYES PHYIR 'BUL, ,AOm A'A: H'Um, ,'DOD DGU'I DPAL LA ROL PAS TSIMS MDZAD NAS, ,AE MA HO, ,BYIN RLABS CHAR CHEN DBAB TU GSOL,\", \"wylie\": \"ho, ,ting 'dzin sngags dang phyag rgyas byin brlabs pa'i, ,zag med bdud rtsi'i tshogs mchod rgya mtsho 'di, ,rtsa brgyud bla ma'i tshogs rnams mnyes phyir 'bul, ,aoM a'a: hUM, ,'dod dgu'i dpal la rol pas tshims mdzad nas, ,ae ma ho, ,byin rlabs char chen dbab tu gsol\", \"english\": \"Ho! We offer this ocean Of gifts of the Gathering, Immaculate nectar Blessed by our concentration, By our secret words, And by our secret signs, To the gathering Of all our root and lineage Lamas; May You be pleased. Om ah hung, Take Your fill, Revel in these thousand Objects of the senses; Eh ma ho, Send down on us A great rain of Your blessings.\"}"
      },
      {
        "id": 14130,
        "course": "TCS08PabongkaSadhana",
        "seq": 392,
        "acip": ",HO, ,TING 'DZIN SNGAGS DANG PHYAG RGYAS BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,ZAG MED BDUD RTZI'I TSOGS MCHOD RGYA MTSO 'DI, ,RNAL 'BYOR DBANG MO'I LHA TSOGS MNYES PHYIR 'BUL, ,AOm A'A: H'Um, 'DOD DGU'I DPAL LA ROL PAS TSIMS MDZAD NAS, ,AE MA HO, ,MKHA' SPYOD DNGOS GRUB STZAL DU GSOL,",
        "wylie": "ho, ,ting 'dzin sngags dang phyag rgyas byin brlabs pa'i, ,zag med bdud rtsi'i tshogs mchod rgya mtsho 'di, ,rnal 'byor dbang mo'i lha tshogs mnyes phyir 'bul, ,aoM a'a: hUM, 'dod dgu'i dpal la rol pas tshims mdzad nas, ,ae ma ho, ,mkha' spyod dngos grub stsal du gsol",
        "english": "Ho! We offer this ocean Of gifts of the Gathering, Immaculate nectar Blessed by our concentration, By our secret words, And by our secret signs, To the gathering Of Angels and their Queen; May You be pleased. Om ah hung, Take Your fill, Revel in these thousand Objects of the senses; Eh ma ho, Grant us all the goals Of the Heaven of the Angel.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS08PabongkaSadhana\", \"acip\": \",HO, ,TING 'DZIN SNGAGS DANG PHYAG RGYAS BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,ZAG MED BDUD RTZI'I TSOGS MCHOD RGYA MTSO 'DI, ,RNAL 'BYOR DBANG MO'I LHA TSOGS MNYES PHYIR 'BUL, ,AOm A'A: H'Um, 'DOD DGU'I DPAL LA ROL PAS TSIMS MDZAD NAS, ,AE MA HO, ,MKHA' SPYOD DNGOS GRUB STZAL DU GSOL,\", \"wylie\": \"ho, ,ting 'dzin sngags dang phyag rgyas byin brlabs pa'i, ,zag med bdud rtsi'i tshogs mchod rgya mtsho 'di, ,rnal 'byor dbang mo'i lha tshogs mnyes phyir 'bul, ,aoM a'a: hUM, 'dod dgu'i dpal la rol pas tshims mdzad nas, ,ae ma ho, ,mkha' spyod dngos grub stsal du gsol\", \"english\": \"Ho! We offer this ocean Of gifts of the Gathering, Immaculate nectar Blessed by our concentration, By our secret words, And by our secret signs, To the gathering Of Angels and their Queen; May You be pleased. Om ah hung, Take Your fill, Revel in these thousand Objects of the senses; Eh ma ho, Grant us all the goals Of the Heaven of the Angel.\"}"
      },
      {
