        "wylie": "ho, ,ting 'dzin sngags dang phyag rgyas byin brlabs pa'i, ,zag med bdud rtsi'i tshogs mchod rgya mtsho 'di, ,yi dam lha tshogs 'khor bcas mnyes phyir 'bul, ,aoM a'a: hUM, ,'dod dgu'i dpal la rol pas tshims mdzad nas, ,ae ma ho, ,dngos grub char chen dbab tu gsol",
        "english": "Ho! We offer this ocean Of gifts of the Gathering, Immaculate nectar Blessed by our concentration, By our secret words, And by our secret signs, To the gathering Of Angels and Close Angels; May You be pleased. Om ah hung, Take Your fill, Revel in these thousand Objects of the senses; Eh ma ho, Send down on us A great rain of attainments.",
        "raw": "{\"course\": \"TCS08PabongkaSadhana\", \"acip\": \",HO, ,TING 'DZIN SNGAGS DANG PHYAG RGYAS BYIN BRLABS PA'I, ,ZAG MED BDUD RTZI'I TSOGS MCHOD RGYA MTSO 'DI, ,YI DAM LHA TSOGS 'KHOR BCAS MNYES PHYIR 'BUL, ,AOm A'A: H'Um, ,'DOD DGU'I DPAL LA ROL PAS TSIMS MDZAD NAS, ,AE MA HO, ,DNGOS GRUB CHAR CHEN DBAB TU GSOL,\", \"wylie\": \"ho, ,ting 'dzin sngags dang phyag rgyas byin brlabs pa'i, ,zag med bdud rtsi'i tshogs mchod rgya mtsho 'di, ,yi dam lha tshogs 'khor bcas mnyes phyir 'bul, ,aoM a'a: hUM, ,'dod dgu'i dpal la rol pas tshims mdzad nas, ,ae ma ho, ,dngos grub char chen dbab tu gsol\", \"english\": \"Ho! We offer this ocean Of gifts of the Gathering, Immaculate nectar Blessed by our concentration, By our secret words, And by our secret signs, To the gathering Of Angels and Close Angels; May You be pleased. Om ah hung, Take Your fill, Revel in these thousand Objects of the senses; Eh ma ho, Send down on us A great rain of attainments.\"}"
      },
      {
